              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathatha izinduna zamakhulu, nezikhulu, nababusi babantu, nabo bonke abantu bezwe, wehlisa inkosi endlini kaJehova, bangena ngeSango Eliphakeme endlini yenkosi, inkosi esihlalweni sobukhosi.",
          "type": "text",
